.TH "POSIX" "3" "" "pstring 1.5" "pstring manual"
.SH NAME
posix \- API reference
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fB#include <posix.h>\fR
.fi
.PP
.nf
\fBstatic const struct pstrexpr_vt pstrexpr_posix_vt;\fR
.fi
.PP
.nf
\fBPSTR_INLINE int pstrexpr_register_posix(const char *prefix);\fR
.fi
.SH REFERENCE
.SS pstrexpr_posix_vt
.PP
The vtable, in case you want to register it under a different name.
.SS pstrexpr_register_posix
.PP
Registers POSIX regex under \fBprefix\fR, "posix" if it's \fBNULL\fR.
.PP
\fBErrors\fR
.PP
see \fBpstrexpr_register\fR.
